[[Image:MedicT.png|left]]''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|If you love to help friends in need and save people from harm, become a Medic, and use medicine to heal allies, as well as attack angry enemies. Trained by [[Doctor Gordon]], Medics can combine technology and natural ingredients to ward off poisons, heal team members and even use shock paddles to stun enemies.|Job description}}</font>''
'''Medic''' is a combat [[Jobs|job]], specializing in long-distance combat using medicine to heal allies. A combat class job, experience is gained by completing Medic [[Quests|quests]] and by battling in combat instances in the [[Wilds]] and in [[Dungeons|dungeons]].

==Unlocking Medic==
Medic can be unlocked by visiting Nurse Naia at the hospital in [[Sanctuary]].

==Trainers==
* Nurse Naia in Sanctuary (unlocks)
* [[Doctor Gordon]] in Sanctuary (will block partway until lvl 5)
* Terrence in the [[The Roadhouse|Roadhouse]]
* Clover in Sanctuary (will block partway until lvl 10)
* [[Mayor Crystalline]] in [[Snowhill]]
* Docaloc in [[Briarwood]] (will block partway until lvl 15)
* [[Doctor Callahan]] in [[Seaside]] (will block partway until lvl 20)

